  "description": "A great escape from an island town! \n\nTwo girls living different lives find their paths cross on an island—Seo-Ra, a transfer student from Seoul, and Ba-Da, an islander who's never left the island. One thing they have in common is the desire to get away, which leads them to join forces in an escape plan from the island. \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
